OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 14 JUN
OL,4,G1330FMusic Map
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch explores the
OL,6,     Gpathways to one of football
OL,7,     Gfanatic Shostakovich's most
OL,8,     Gcelebrated works, with Handel's
OL,9,     GUEFA anthem and balalaikas from
OL,10,     GJoe Hisaishi along the way.
OL,11,G1500FMark Radcliffe's Nature Ramblings
OL,12,     GIn the final part of Mark
OL,13,     GRadcliffe's Nature Ramblings, he
OL,14,     Gfeatures music inspired by
OL,15,     Grivers, including Wagner, Delius,
OL,16,     GSmetana and Joni Mitchell.
OL,17,G1600FJazz Record Requests
OL,18,     GAlyn Shipton looks at the music
OL,19,     Gthat marks life's milestones with
OL,20,     Gyour personal dedications and
OL,21,     Gjazz memories.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
