OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 14 JUN
OL,4,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,5,     GErik Bosgraaf directs the Wroclaw
OL,6,     GBaroque Orchestra at last year's
OL,7,     GLondon International Festival of
OL,8,     GEarly Music, in music by Vivaldi
OL,9,     Gand a precociously young Mozart.
OL,10,G1800FChoral Evensong
OL,11,     GFrom the Chapel of Keble College,
OL,12,     GOxford, with music by Wood,
OL,13,     GWesley, Stainer and Parry.
OL,14,G1900FSunday Feature: The Mysteries of
OL,15,     FGwen John
OL,16,     GGwyneth Lewis explores the
OL,17,     Gmysteries surrounding the Welsh
OL,18,     Gpainter Gwen John - an
OL,19,     Guncompromising artist who
OL,20,     Gchallenged convention and led a
OL,21,     Gstrange and fascinating life.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
