OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 14 JUN
OL,4,G1945FWords and Music
OL,5,     GFrom the diaries of Pepys and
OL,6,     GJohn Evelyn and the music of
OL,7,     GPurcell and Blow, and films such
OL,8,     Gas The Libertine.
OL,9,G2100FUltimate Calm with Erland Cooper
OL,10,     GTake a forage in the forest with
OL,11,     GErland Cooper, and a selection of
OL,12,     Gpeaceful music inspired by the
OL,13,     Gtrees. Plus a safe haven from
OL,14,     GJapanese sound artist and
OL,15,     Gcomposer Hiroshi Ebina.
OL,16,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,17,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,18,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,19,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,20,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,21,     Geverything in between.
